#: ../../source/tweetnacl_CHANGELOG.md:209
msgid ""
"Fast version: increased theoretical message size limit from 2^32-1 to "
"2^52 bytes in Poly1305 (and thus, secretbox and box). However this has no"
" impact in practice since JavaScript arrays or ArrayBuffers are limited "
"to 32-bit indexes, and most implementations won't allocate more than a "
"gigabyte or so. (Obviously, there are no tests for the correctness of "
"implementation.) Also, it's not recommended to use messages that large "
"without splitting them into smaller packets anyway."
msgstr ""

